.Dd January 25, 2026
.Dt DEVICE_REFCOUNT 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm device_get ,
.Nm device_put
.Nd manage device reference counts
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/device.h
.Ft void
.Fn device_get "struct device *dev"
.Ft void
.Fn device_put "struct device *dev"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn device_get
function increments the reference count of a device structure.
.Pp
The
.Fn device_put
function decrements the reference count. If the reference count reaches zero, the device structure is freed.
.Pp
If
.Fa dev
is NULL, these functions do nothing.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
None.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr device 9 ,
.Xr device_create 9
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn device_get
and
.Fn device_put
kernel interfaces first appeared in Substrate.
